    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — SEPARATE PROGRAMMING-SCHOOL ARCHITECTURE REMOVED\n\nFresh current `AGENTS.md` on `main@9e2f6309e3aa452c42b859eaa515641fea7e3f09` defines continuous task-driven DUNCAN learning with no separate mandatory learning ceremony/subsystem. Parent #206 is closed, old LESTER execution surfaces are retired (#263), and #251 is the only product NEXT router at P01.\n\nThe useful laws (evidence-first learning, transfer before PROVEN, SHERIFF separation) remain in current authority. The separate `LESTER PROGRAMMING SCHOOL / Inspect/SWE-Gym` workstream must not remain active.\n\nDisposition: close `NOT_PLANNED / SUPERSEDED LEARNING ARCHITECTURE`.",
